  "description": "Card Cook is a card-themed play station in Sea Green and blue, built from folded panels with cut-outs. A red slide, an arched net climber, a rope net tunnel and a curved ladder are packed into one frame. It is designed for younger children, ages 3 to 9, and the cut-out panels give them windows to peep through as they move round. Activities cover climbing, sliding, hanging, balancing and crawling, which build coordination and gross motor skills. It takes up to 15 children. The product area is 13'5\" x 11'8\" and the safe play area is 17'11\" x 16'8\". The galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope have a 3-year warranty. Ask us for a layout drawing for your nursery or society park.",
